WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:09.420
(Welcome to the underground. Breathe in, breathe in, breathe in.)

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:15.900
Izquierda,
(left.)

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:17.880
Derecha,
(right.)

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.780
Adelante,
(forward.)

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:21.560
Atrás,
(back.)

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:23.340
Siente la nota,
(feel the note.)

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:25.260
Quiero más,
(I want more.)

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:26.320
Arriba,
(up.)

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:27.780
Abajo,
(down.)

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:30.240
Cierra los ojos,
(close your eyes.)

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:32.160
Sin trabajo,
(without work.)

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:36.700
La mente en blanco,
(the mind blank. Lose your thoughts.)

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:40.500
El pulso sube,
(the pulse goes up. Connect the dots.)

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:46.160
En la discoteca,
(in the club, all night long.)

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:49.920
Nadie nos ve,
(nobody sees us. Sing the song.)

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:53.720
Suda la gota,
(sweat the drop. Don't you stop.)

00:00:53.820 --> 00:01:13.550
Rompe la pista,
(break the floor to the top. Keep moving, moving, moving, moving. Don't stop, stop, stop, stop, stop, stop, stop, stop, stop, stop, stop, stop, stop, stop, stop.)

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:14.480
Lunes,
(Monday.)

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:15.460
Martes,
(Tuesday.)

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.800
No importa el día,
(the day doesn't matter.)

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:19.760
Solo la noche,
(only the night.)

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:21.660
Y la energía,
(and the energy.)

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:22.440
Negro,
(black.)

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:23.420
Blanco,
(white.)

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:25.420
Colores oscuros,
(dark colors.)

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:28.080
Rompiendo muros,
(breaking walls.)

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:31.920
La mente en blanco,
(the mind blank. Lose your thoughts.)

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:35.700
El pulso sube,
(the pulse goes up. Connect the dots.)

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:41.400
En la discoteca,
(in the club, all night long.)

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:45.160
Nadie nos ve,
(nobody sees us. Sing the song.)

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:48.900
Suda la gota,
(sweat the drop. Don't you stop.)

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:51.180
Rompe la pista,
(break the floor.)

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:55.720
Respira profundo,
(breathe deep.)

00:01:56.020 --> 00:01:59.940
El sonido es tuyo,
(the sound is yours.)

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:15.720
En la discoteca,
(in the club. Dance.)

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:18.080
Nadie nos ve,
(nobody sees us.)

00:02:34.880 --> 00:03:12.680
Hasta mañana,
(until tomorrow. Good night. Good night.)
